<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Alex Carter | Portfolio</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Portfolio website template for a designer, developer, or creative professional."
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #0b1020;
        --bg-soft: #121a2b;
        --card: #1a2337;
        --text: #ecf2ff;
        --muted: #a7b4d1;
        --primary: #7c9cff;
        --secondary: #5ae4b8;
        --accent: #ff9f6e;
        --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        --shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      img {
        max-width: 100%;
        display: block;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      header {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 20;
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        background: rgba(11, 16, 32, 0.75);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        min-height: 72px;
      }

      .brand {
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
        align-items: center;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.96rem;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .cta {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 12px 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
        color: #08111d;
        font-weight: 700;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 100px 0 70px;
      }

      .hero-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 48px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        background: rgba(90, 228, 184, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(90, 228, 184, 0.25);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 24px 0 16px;
        font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 5rem);
        line-height: 1.02;
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      }

      .lead {
        max-width: 640px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 32px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .button-secondary {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 12px 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--text);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      }

      .stats {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 26px;
        margin-top: 38px;
      }

      .stat {
        min-width: 120px;
      }

      .stat strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.7rem;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .stat span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .profile-card {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 28px;
        padding: 22px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .avatar {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: 24px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
        min-height: 470px;
      }

      .avatar::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(255,255,255,0.28), transparent 20%),
          linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), transparent 45%);
      }

      .avatar img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.08);
        mix-blend-mode: screen;
        opacity: 0.9;
      }

      .mini-card {
        margin-top: 18px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
      }

      .mini-card strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .mini-card span {
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      section {
        padding: 60px 0;
      }

      .section-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: end;
        gap: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }

      .section-header h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }

      .section-header p {
        color: var(--muted);
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 560px;
      }

      .grid-3 {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 24px;
      }

      .card {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 22px;
        padding: 26px;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
      }

      .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-4px);
        border-color: rgba(124, 156, 255, 0.5);
      }

      .icon {
        width: 50px;
        height: 50px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,156,255,0.2), rgba(90,228,184,0.12));
        color: var(--secondary);
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .card h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: 1.35rem;
      }

      .card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .projects-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 24px;
      }

      .project {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 24px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .project-visual {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124, 156, 255, 0.18), rgba(255,159,110,0.12));
        min-height: 220px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      }

      .project-body {
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .project-body h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }

      .project-body p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .tags {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      .tags span {
        padding: 7px 10px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
      }

      .timeline {
        display: grid;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .timeline-item {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr;
        gap: 24px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 22px 24px;
      }

      .timeline-date {
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .timeline-item h3 {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .timeline-item p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .contact {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(124,156,255,0.04), rgba(90,228,184,0.03));
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .contact-box {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
        gap: 24px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .contact-box h2 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }

      .contact-box p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .contact-actions {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      footer {
        padding: 26px 0 50px;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-align: center;
      }

      @media (max-width: 860px) {
        .hero-grid,
        .contact-box,
        .timeline-item {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .nav-links {
          display: none;
        }

        .grid-3,
        .projects-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .section-header {
          display: block;
        }

        .section-header p {
          margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .contact-actions {
          justify-content: flex-start;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="container nav">
        <a href="#top" class="brand">Alex Carter</a>
        <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="#about">About</a>
          <a href="#services">Services</a>
          <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
          <a href="#experience">Experience</a>
          <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
        <a class="cta" href="#contact">Hire Me</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Available for freelance work</span>
            <h1>Designing digital experiences that feel human.</h1>
            <p class="lead">
              I’m a product designer and front-end developer helping startups and
              brands turn ideas into polished, user-centered products.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="cta" href="#projects">View My Work</a>
              <a class="button-secondary" href="#contact">Let’s Talk</a>
            </div>

            <div class="stats">
              <div class="stat">
                <strong>6+</strong>
                <span>Years Experience</span>
              </div>
              <div class="stat">
                <strong>35</strong>
                <span>Projects Delivered</span>
              </div>
              <div class="stat">
                <strong>12</strong>
                <span>Clients Worldwide</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="profile-card">
            <div class="avatar">
              <img
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80"
                alt="Portrait of Alex Carter"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="mini-card">
              <div>
                <strong>Based in New York</strong>
                <span>Design + Development</span>
              </div>
              <span>● Available</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="about">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-header">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>
              I blend strategy, design, and engineering to create intuitive products
              that are visually refined and easy to use.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid-3">
            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon">01</div>
              <h3>Strategy</h3>
              <p>
                I work closely with teams to define user needs, business goals, and
                product direction before design moves forward.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon">02</div>
              <h3>Design</h3>
              <p>
                I design clean interfaces and experiences with strong visual systems,
                accessible interactions, and thoughtful storytelling.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon">03</div>
              <h3>Development</h3>
              <p>
                I also build front-end experiences that match the design closely,
                ensuring a smooth product experience from concept to launch.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="services">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-header">
            <h2>What I Do</h2>
            <p>
              My work supports founders, teams, and brands looking for design systems,
              product polish, and digital experiences that convert.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid-3">
            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon">UX</div>
              <h3>UX Design</h3>
              <p>
                Wireframes, user flows, prototyping, and product thinking grounded
                in usability and measurable outcomes.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon">UI</div>
              <h3>UI Design</h3>
              <p>
                High-fidelity interfaces, visual design systems, and polished
                user-facing experiences across web and mobile products.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon">FE</div>
              <h3>Frontend</h3>
              <p>
                Responsive builds, clean HTML/CSS/JS implementation, and
                performance-focused front-end development.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="projects">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Selected Work</h2>
            <p>
              A few examples of products and digital experiences I’ve designed and
              built to solve real user and business problems.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="projects-grid">
            <article class="project">
              <div class="project-visual">Nova</div>
              <div class="project-body">
                <h3>Nova Analytics Platform</h3>
                <p>
                  A data dashboard for marketing teams to track performance, customer
                  behavior, and campaign insights in real time.
                </p>
                <div class="tags">
                  <span>Product Design</span>
                  <span>Dashboard</span>
                  <span>UX Research</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="project">
              <div class="project-visual">Aster</div>
              <div class="project-body">
                <h3>Aster Studio</h3>
                <p>
                  A brand and portfolio experience for a creative studio, built to
                  highlight case studies and attract high-value clients.
                </p>
                <div class="tags">
                  <span>Branding</span>
                  <span>Portfolio</span>
                  <span>Web Design</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="project">
              <div class="project-visual">Lune</div>
              <div class="project-body">
                <h3>Lune Commerce</h3>
                <p>
                  An eCommerce redesign focused on simplifying purchasing flows,
                  trust-building, and conversion improvements.
                </p>
                <div class="tags">
                  <span>eCommerce</span>
                  <span>UI Design</span>
                  <span>Conversion</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="project">
              <div class="project-visual">Orbit</div>
              <div class="project-body">
                <h3>Orbit SaaS App</h3>
                <p>
                  A SaaS onboarding and workflow system designed to help teams onboard
                  faster and reduce product confusion.
                </p>
                <div class="tags">
                  <span>SaaS</span>
                  <span>UX</span>
                  <span>Prototyping</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="experience">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Experience</h2>
            <p>
              Over the years, I’ve helped teams from startups to established brands
              deliver digital products with better clarity and stronger outcomes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline">
            <div class="timeline-item">
              <div class="timeline-date">2022 — Present</div>
              <div>
                <h3>Senior Product Designer</h3>
                <p>
                  Leading design strategy, UI systems, and product improvements for
                  a B2B SaaS platform serving growing teams across multiple industries.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item">
              <div class="timeline-date">2019 — 2022</div>
              <div>
                <h3>UX/UI Designer</h3>
                <p>
                  Designed experiences for startups and agencies, specializing in
                  conversion-focused landing pages, dashboards, and eCommerce flows.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item">
              <div class="timeline-date">2016 — 2019</div>
              <div>
                <h3>Visual Designer</h3>
                <p>
                  Created brand identities and digital marketing assets, translating
                  business goals into clear and compelling visual systems.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact" id="contact">
        <div class="container contact-box">
          <div>
            <h2>Let’s build something meaningful.</h2>
            <p>
              I’m open to freelance projects, collaborations, and product design
              opportunities. Let’s talk about your vision.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-actions">
            <a class="cta" href="mailto:alex@example.com">alex@example.com</a>
            <a class="button-secondary" href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="container">
        © 2026 Alex Carter. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
